@startuml
title 统计与预警 DTO 类图 — Iteration 2（最终）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam wrapWidth 165
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 40
hide empty members
hide circle
top to bottom direction

package "dto · 统计" {
  class ClassStatistics <<record>> {
    + classId: long
    + className: String
    + studentCount: int
    + scoreCount: int
    + dataStatus: DataStatus
    + average: Double
    + passRate: Double
    + highest: Double
    + lowest: Double
    + courses: List<CourseStatistics>
  }
  class CourseStatistics <<record>> {
    + classCourseId: long
    + courseCode: String
    + courseName: String
    + teacherName: String
    + scoreCount: int
    + dataStatus: DataStatus
    + average: Double
    + passRate: Double
    + highest: Double
    + lowest: Double
  }
  class StudentStatistics <<record>> {
    + studentId: long
    + studentNo: String
    + name: String
    + scoreCount: int
    + dataStatus: DataStatus
    + average: Double
    + failedCount: Integer
    + rank: Integer
    + rankNote: String
    + details: List<ScoreDetail>
  }
  class ScoreDetail <<record>> {
    + classId: long
    + className: String
    + courseId: long
    + courseCode: String
    + courseName: String
    + score: double
    + updatedAt: LocalDateTime
  }
  class RankEntry <<record>> {
    + rank: int
    + studentId: long
    + studentNo: String
    + name: String
    + average: double
    + failedCount: int
  }
  class StudentMetrics <<record>> {
    + studentId: long
    + scoreCount: int
    + average: Double
    + failedCount: Integer
  }
}

package "dto · 预警" {
  class WarningResult <<record>> {
    + studentId: long
    + studentNo: String
    + name: String
    + level: WarningLevel
    + average: Double
    + failedCount: Integer
    + hitRules: List<String>
  }
  class ClassWarning <<record>> {
    + classId: long
    + className: String
    + level: ClassWarningLevel
    + passRate: Double
    + average: Double
    + scoreCount: int
  }
  enum WarningLevel {
    SEVERE
    MODERATE
    MILD
    NORMAL
    INSUFFICIENT_DATA
  }
  enum ClassWarningLevel {
    NEEDS_ATTENTION
    NORMAL
    INSUFFICIENT_DATA
  }
}

package "dto · 通用" {
  enum DataStatus {
    AVAILABLE
    INSUFFICIENT
  }
}

ClassStatistics *-- "0..*" CourseStatistics : courses
StudentStatistics *-- "0..*" ScoreDetail : details
ClassStatistics --> DataStatus
CourseStatistics --> DataStatus
StudentStatistics --> DataStatus
WarningResult --> WarningLevel
ClassWarning --> ClassWarningLevel

note bottom of ClassStatistics
  班级统计聚合各门课程统计。
  studentCount 是全班人数，
  不受教师可见课程范围影响。
  dataStatus = INSUFFICIENT 时
  四个指标为 null，界面显示“数据不足”。
end note

note bottom of StudentStatistics
  scoreCount 是可见范围内的成绩条数；
  rank 为空表示不参与排名，
  rankNote 给出原因（如本班暂无成绩）。
end note

note bottom of WarningResult
  评估 R1–R6 并收集全部命中规则，
  取最高等级输出；
  无可见成绩时 level = INSUFFICIENT_DATA，
  average / failedCount 为 null。
end note

note bottom of DataStatus
  AVAILABLE：有可见成绩，指标可读；
  INSUFFICIENT：无可见成绩，指标不适用。
  所有 List 字段在 record 构造器中
  用 List.copyOf 转成不可变副本。
  空列表表示“没有明细”，不是“数据不足”。
end note

@enduml
